   "updated": 1760572800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. One database per client",
   "originalText": "1. One database per client",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "cardb0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 2515.0,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 340.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1982979742,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 780520226,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760572800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "one client = one deployment = one database\n  (ADR 0011)\nno client column, no RLS, no per-request setting\nPK id uuid (UUIDv7 from the app)\nplain FKs: product_id -> products (id)\nbusiness: one row (PK id = true)\n  created by `shopkeeper setup`\n  with default location, roles, first owner\n\nuse case -> tx.Runner.InTx(ctx, fn)\n  repositories use postgres.Executor(ctx)\n  commit on nil, rollback on error/panic\n\nroles: shopkeeper_app (not owner)\n       shopkeeper_migrator (owner)\n  -> append-only tables keep\n     REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE",
   "originalText": "one client = one deployment = one database\n  (ADR 0011)\nno client column, no RLS, no per-request setting\nPK id uuid (UUIDv7 from the app)\nplain FKs: product_id -> products (id)\nbusiness: one row (PK id = true)\n  created by `shopkeeper setup`\n  with default location, roles, first owner\n\nuse case -> tx.Runner.InTx(ctx, fn)\n  repositories use postgres.Executor(ctx)\n  commit on nil, rollback on error/panic\n\nroles: shopkeeper_app (not owner)\n       shopkeeper_migrator (owner)\n  -> append-only tables keep\n     REVOKE UPDATE, DELETE",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
