   "updated": 1760572800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. Units and fractional sales",
   "originalText": "2. Units and fractional sales",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "cardb1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 630,
   "y": 2515.0,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 340.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 909074013,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1952918746,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760572800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "product: Adhesive vinyl 1.27 m\n  base unit = m (fraction allowed)\n  product_units:\n    m   factor 1     sale\n    rl  factor 50    purchase + sale\n  variant_prices (per unit):\n    m   R$ 18.00\n    rl  R$ 750.00  (own price,\n         not 50 x 18.00 = 900.00)\n\nsell 2.5 m -> quantity 2.500 m\n             base_quantity 2.500\nsell 1 rl  -> quantity 1.000 rl\n             base_quantity 50.000\n\nstock is always in the base unit\nbase_quantity = quantity x factor",
   "originalText": "product: Adhesive vinyl 1.27 m\n  base unit = m (fraction allowed)\n  product_units:\n    m   factor 1     sale\n    rl  factor 50    purchase + sale\n  variant_prices (per unit):\n    m   R$ 18.00\n    rl  R$ 750.00  (own price,\n         not 50 x 18.00 = 900.00)\n\nsell 2.5 m -> quantity 2.500 m\n             base_quantity 2.500\nsell 1 rl  -> quantity 1.000 rl\n             base_quantity 50.000\n\nstock is always in the base unit\nbase_quantity = quantity x factor",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
