   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "gross revenue        SUM(sales.total_cents)  completed\n- Simples (estimate)  total x effective_rate of the month\n- card fees           SUM(sales.fee_cents)\n= net revenue\n- COGS                SUM(sales.cogs_cents)  (frozen at sale)\n= gross profit\n- expenses            kind IN (operating, tax, financial)\n= net profit\n\ninventory_purchase, owner_withdrawal -> cash flow only\nreceivable overdue = status open AND due_on < today (Manaus)",
   "originalText": "gross revenue        SUM(sales.total_cents)  completed\n- Simples (estimate)  total x effective_rate of the month\n- card fees           SUM(sales.fee_cents)\n= net revenue\n- COGS                SUM(sales.cogs_cents)  (frozen at sale)\n= gross profit\n- expenses            kind IN (operating, tax, financial)\n= net profit\n\ninventory_purchase, owner_withdrawal -> cash flow only\nreceivable overdue = status open AND due_on < today (Manaus)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
