   "text": "RBT12(P) = SUM monthly_gross_revenue P-12 .. P-1\nrate = (RBT12 x nominal - deduction) / RBT12\n500,000 -> (47,500 - 13,860) / 500,000\n       = 6.728 %  (Annex I, bracket 3)\ntax_profiles.manual_rate always wins\nbrackets are data with valid_from (law changes)",
